<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Growth names investment adviser.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Growth names investment adviser.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai International Shanghai Growth Investment Ltd said on Thursday that Hambro Dah Sing Ltd had become the company's new investment adviser, replacing another company from the Hambros Plc group.</p>
<p>The change of investment adviser will not materially affect the company, Shanghai Growth said in a statement.</p>
<p>The China investment fund said Hambro Pacific Fund Management Ltd had been its investment adviser since 1993, before an internal reorganisation of the Hambros group last year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
